    title: "prng-lattice-lab"
    doi: "10.5281/zenodo.22697185"
    repository-code: "https://github.com/erxxc/prng-lattice-lab"
    notes: >-
      Independent research harness related to the bounded weak-RNG evidence boundary;
      RepoAuditor does not import or execute it.
